## Core / collections

Soft builtins (i64 monomorphized, region id `0` = current bump region):

```
let v = vec_new(0)
vec_push(v, 1)
let x = vec_get(v, 0)
let n = vec_len(v)

let m = map_new(0)
map_insert(m, 1, 10)
let y = map_get(m, 1)
```

Arrays `[1, 2, 3]` are language literals with bounds-checked index + BCE.
